•	AgressorSide → TradeAggressor (Buy/Sell/Unknown)
•	trade.Timestamp → trade.Time
•	Engine_OnConnectionChanged(bool) → Engine_OnConnectionChanged(ConnectionChangedEvent)
•	_engine.Start("WIN") → _engine.ConnectAsync(new ProviderCredentials("","","")) + _engine.Subscribe("WIN")
•	_engine.SpoofDetector → _engine.Spoof (nomes abreviados no MarketEngine)
